        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>案例与思考 - 幼儿园探究活动记录</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #222;\n    max-width: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px 30px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .page-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 10px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #c0522d;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .title-cn {\n    color: #c0522d;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .title-en {\n    color: #c0522d;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---- Top flowchart section ---- */\n  .top-flow {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .flow-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .flow-col-header {\n    background: #c0522d;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 4px 2px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .left-box, .right-box {\n    background: #eae4f2;\n    border: 1px solid #cbb9dd;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 6px 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .right-box {\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    text-align: left;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n  }\n  .mid-box {\n    background: #dbe9f5;\n    border: 1px solid #9ec1de;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    padding: 4px 2px;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  .arrow-down {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin: 1px 0;\n  }\n\n  h3.sub-head {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 12px 0 6px;\n  }\n  h4.sub-head2 {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 12px 0 6px;\n  }\n  p { margin: 6px 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; }\n  strong.inline-lead { font-weight: bold; }\n\n  /* ---- Right side project diagram (floated) ---- */\n  .project-diagram {\n    float: right;\n    width: 300px;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 14px;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding: 8px;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .proj-title-box {\n    text-align: center;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .proj-title-box .small {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  .proj-title-box .big {\n    color: #c0522d;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .proj-split {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .proj-split div {\n    flex: 1;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 3px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n  table.proj-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  table.proj-table th, table.proj-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #bbb;\n    padding: 3px 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  table.proj-table th {\n    background: #e6c9b8;\n  }\n\n  footer {\n    clear: both;\n    border-top: 1px solid #999;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #444;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .watermark-note {\n    display: none;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"page-header\">\n    <span class=\"title-cn\">案例与思考</span>\n    <span class=\"title-en\">CASE AND CONSIDERATION</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Top flowchart: 3-column support strategy diagram -->\n  <div class=\"top-flow\">\n    <div class=\"flow-col\">\n      <div class=\"flow-col-header\">总结支持策略</div>\n      <div class=\"left-box\">支持幼儿自主选择材料</div>\n      <div class=\"left-box\">保障幼儿充足探索时间</div>\n      <div class=\"left-box\">提供丰富多样的实验探究材料</div>\n      <div class=\"left-box\">有一次性的[?]<br>不轻易呈现材料<br>开展深入的探索</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow-col\">\n      <div class=\"flow-col-header\">过程</div>\n      <div class=\"mid-box\">提出问题<br>过程假设</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-down\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"mid-box\">简单地投</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-down\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"mid-box\">PVC管道水</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-down\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"mid-box\">石头浮起</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-down\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"mid-box\">塑料瓶浮起</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-down\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"mid-box\">小金鱼游</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow-col\">\n      <div class=\"flow-col-header\">过程性支持策略</div>\n      <div class=\"right-box\">[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"right-box\">[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"right-box\">[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"right-box\">[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"right-box\">[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"right-box\">[illegible]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>开展，幼儿在多次探究中会试解决\"海洋池\"问题。整个探究活动包含较多的自然探索的过程，也如规划中设计\"海洋池\"，探索性设置着装备、水渗入沙的阻隔。</p>\n\n  <p><strong class=\"inline-lead\">走进自然，亲近泥土。</strong>本次活动由户外沙水区开展，是幼儿关注自然的重要机会。幼儿与泥沙、石头等自然资源开发了有效的互动，感受到了自然的丰富的本质特性和特性，户外场地拓展了更加宽阔的活动空间，为幼儿充分的探索活动提供了地地方。</p>\n\n  <p><strong class=\"inline-lead\">学习发展，清晰可见。</strong>中班阶段幼儿的各项能力水平有限，在教师深入的观察和识别和判断的能力发展是需要的。这次探究过程也充分反映了幼儿的学习与发展的过程之若干重要的教育机会。在教师活动中，用水盆理不能地区3-3来那件如此丰富，有观察的探究进程中已显示不那么重要，这其中是教师对中班幼儿年龄特点的正确的理解。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"project-diagram\">\n    <div class=\"proj-title-box\">\n      <div class=\"small\">明确项目内容</div>\n      <div class=\"big\">欢乐海洋池</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:10px;color:#888;\">▼</div>\n    <div class=\"proj-split\">\n      <div>设计图：长方形水池</div>\n      <div>初步规划<br>选址：靠近未来班沙坑</div>\n    </div>\n    <table class=\"proj-table\">\n      <tr><th>过程</th><th>探究策略</th><th>探究结果</th></tr>\n      <tr><td>第一次挖坑</td><td>[illegible]</td><td>[illegible]</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>第二次挖坑</td><td>[illegible]</td><td>[illegible]</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>第三次挖坑</td><td>[illegible]</td><td>[illegible]</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>第四次挖坑</td><td>[illegible]</td><td>[illegible]</td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3 class=\"sub-head\">2. 教师的支持策略分析。</h3>\n\n  <p>本次目活动在清洗海洋生物的讨论中，幼儿形成了制作\"海洋池\"的共同愿望。幼儿通过想法各自的探究方式，四位后经历了四次挖坑和堆坝，凸显了幼儿在活动过程中所拥有的丰富的经验、认真严谨的态度和不怕困难、敢于探究和尝试的意识，也在创造性思维等品质方面得到锻炼。</p>\n\n  <h4 class=\"sub-head2\">(二) 幼儿的反思</h4>\n\n  <p>探究问题，采纳幼儿的解决方案：\"投机取巧\"。虽然是幼儿在活动中呈现的活动方式，凸显了幼儿在活动中所拥有的丰富的经验、认真严谨的态度和不怕困难、敢于探究和尝试的意识，也在一次次的实践中总结出的经验。</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
